OL,3,AJurors in Clancy trial told to return
OL,4,Atomorrow after failing to reach verdict
OL,5,Aagain
OL,6,
OL,7,FJurors in Lindsay Clancy's murder trial
OL,8,Ftell the judge they still cannot reach
OL,9,Fa unanimous verdict
OL,11,FThe judge sends the jury home to
OL,12,Fcontinue deliberations tomorrow morning
OL,13,F- what happens if they just can't
OL,14,Fagree?
OL,16,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,17,Fcounts of first-degree murder for
OL,18,Fkilling her children in Massachusetts
OL,19,Fin 2023
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
