OL,3,AJurors in Clancy trial told to return
OL,4,Atomorrow after failing to reach verdict
OL,5,Aagain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former nurse does not dispute
OL,8,Fkilling her two sons and daughter, but
OL,9,Fher lawyer argues she was suffering
OL,10,Ffrom postpartum psychosis at the time,
OL,11,Fand therefore could not distinguish
OL,12,Fright from wrong - what is postpartum
OL,13,Fpsychosis?
OL,15,FThe prosecution argues Clancy made a
OL,16,Fcalculated, intentional decision to
OL,17,Fkill Cora, 5, Dawson, 3, and
OL,18,Feight-month-old Callan - what do we
OL,19,Fknow about them?
